<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/office/assets/hero-DgREzV0G.jpg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/office/assets/styles-DD1mcaRQ.css" data-precedence="default"/><title>Microsoft 365 Setup Guide – Independent Step-by-Step Help</title><meta name="description" content="Independent step-by-step guide to install and activate Office using office.com/setup or microsoft365.com/setup on Windows, Mac, Android, iPhone and iPad."/><meta property="og:title" content="Microsoft 365 Setup Guide – Independent Step-by-Step Help"/><meta property="og:description" content="Independent step-by-step guide to install and activate Office using office.com/setup or microsoft365.com/setup on Windows, Mac, Android, iPhone and iPad."/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/office/assets/index-JHUk6O7B.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/office/assets/routes-D98xS8Fy.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/office/assets/SetupGuide-DtLBz3Cf.js"/><link rel="icon" href="/office/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon"/></head><body><!--$--><div class="min-h-screen bg-background font-sans text-foreground"><header class="sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-border bg-background/90 backdrop-blur"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 px-6 py-4"><span class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-primary">Microsoft 365 Setup &amp; Installation Guide</span><span class="rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-secondary-foreground">Independent guide · not affiliated with Microsoft</span></div></header><main><section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-secondary to-background"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 px-6 py-16 md:grid-cols-2 md:py-20"><div><h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-5xl">What is office.com/setup</h1><p class="mt-5 text-lg text-muted-foreground">office.com/setup is the page where Microsoft Office users easily install, set up, and activate Office on a Windows or Mac system. Microsoft now also offers the same page at microsoft365.com/setup — both addresses are official. Enter your product key, download the setup, and follow the steps below — with a picture for every step.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://www.office.com/setup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-soft transition hover:opacity-90">Get started ↗</a><a href="#windows" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-foreground transition hover:border-primary">See the steps</a></div><p class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">No sign-up · no downloads hosted here · setup happens on official microsoft.com pages</p></div><div><img src="/office/assets/hero-DgREzV0G.jpg" alt="A 2-in-1 laptop and tablet showing Office apps like Word, Excel, and Outlook" width="1280" height="960" class="w-full rounded-3xl shadow-soft"/><div class="mt-4 flex justify-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold"><span class="rounded-full bg-card px-4 py-1.5 text-primary shadow-soft">1<!-- -->. <!-- -->Sign in</span><span class="rounded-full bg-card px-4 py-1.5 text-primary shadow-soft">2<!-- -->. <!-- -->Enter key</span><span class="rounded-full bg-card px-4 py-1.5 text-primary shadow-soft">3<!-- -->. <!-- -->Install</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16"><div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.4fr]"><div><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold">Setup at office.com/setup</h2><p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">The whole process in seven steps. Each step is explained with pictures below. You can use office.com/setup or microsoft365.com/setup — they lead to the same official page.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><ol class="space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">1</span><span class="pt-0.5">Go to office.com/setup (also microsoft365.com/setup) for Office setup.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">2</span><span class="pt-0.5">Sign in or create a new Microsoft account.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">3</span><span class="pt-0.5">Find your Office product key.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">4</span><span class="pt-0.5">Enter the Microsoft Office product key.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">5</span><span class="pt-0.5">Select your country and language.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">6</span><span class="pt-0.5">Download Office setup and follow the on-screen instructions.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">7</span><span class="pt-0.5">Finish the installation and run the applications.</span></li></ol></div></div></section><section id="windows" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-muted py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold">How to install Office on Windows</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">Follow these six steps at office.com/setup or microsoft365.com/setup. Every step happens on the official Microsoft page where the action takes place.</p><ol class="mt-10 space-y-6"><li class="grid items-center gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 md:grid-cols-2 md:p-8"><div class=""><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-lg font-bold text-primary-foreground">1</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Go to office.com/setup</h3><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">Open your browser, visit office.com/setup and select the Office product you want to install. The same page is also available at microsoft365.com/setup.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm">office.com/setup · microsoft365.com/setup</p></div><button aria-label="Enlarge picture for step 1" class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border shadow-soft transition hover:scale-[1.01]"><img src="/office/assets/win1-gL8QBpt4.jpg" alt="Browser open at office.com/setup showing the Office setup page" width="1280" height="800" loading="lazy" class="h-auto w-full"/></button></li><li class="grid items-center gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 md:grid-cols-2 md:p-8"><div class="md:order-2"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-lg font-bold text-primary-foreground">2</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Sign in to your Microsoft account</h3><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">Sign in with the email and password for the account tied to your Office purchase. If you do not have a Microsoft account yet, create one — your product key attaches to it.</p></div><button aria-label="Enlarge picture for step 2" class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border shadow-soft transition hover:scale-[1.01]"><img src="/office/assets/win2-ChtbEFeA.jpg" alt="Account sign-in screen with an email field and Next button" width="1280" height="800" loading="lazy" class="h-auto w-full"/></button></li><li class="grid items-center gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 md:grid-cols-2 md:p-8"><div class=""><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-lg font-bold text-primary-foreground">3</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Find your 25 digits key</h3><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">The key is 25 characters, grouped in five blocks. You find it printed on the retail card, inside the box, or in the confirmation email if you bought Office online.</p></div><button aria-label="Enlarge picture for step 3" class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border shadow-soft transition hover:scale-[1.01]"><img src="/office/assets/win3-DlNhZf8o.jpg" alt="Retail product key card with a 25-character code" width="1280" height="800" loading="lazy" class="h-auto w-full"/></button></li><li class="grid items-center gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 md:grid-cols-2 md:p-8"><div class="md:order-2"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-lg font-bold text-primary-foreground">4</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Enter your 25 digits key</h3><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">Once signed in, type the 25-character code in the product key area, then select your country and the language you want.</p></div><button aria-label="Enlarge picture for step 4" class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border shadow-soft transition hover:scale-[1.01]"><img src="/office/assets/win4-M6Oj2fmq.jpg" alt="Enter your product key page with country and language selectors" width="1280" height="800" loading="lazy" class="h-auto w-full"/></button></li><li class="grid items-center gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 md:grid-cols-2 md:p-8"><div class=""><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-lg font-bold text-primary-foreground">5</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Download and install Office</h3><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">Select Install Office and let the installer download. Run it and follow the on-screen directions to install your registered copy of Microsoft Office.</p></div><button aria-label="Enlarge picture for step 5" class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border shadow-soft transition hover:scale-[1.01]"><img src="/office/assets/win5-CFXy7aWo.jpg" alt="Download page with an Install button and a progress bar" width="1280" height="800" loading="lazy" class="h-auto w-full"/></button></li><li class="grid items-center gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 md:grid-cols-2 md:p-8"><div class="md:order-2"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-lg font-bold text-primary-foreground">6</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Run the activation wizard</h3><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">When the install finishes, open any app such as Word. Follow the prompts on screen and sign in once — the setup goes through activation automatically.</p></div><button aria-label="Enlarge picture for step 6" class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border shadow-soft transition hover:scale-[1.01]"><img src="/office/assets/win6-BVyrJSoY.jpg" alt="First-run screen with a Get started activation button" width="1280" height="800" loading="lazy" class="h-auto w-full"/></button></li></ol></div></section><section id="mac" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-20 px-6 py-16"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold">Install Office on a Mac</h2><div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><ol class="space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">1</span><span class="pt-0.5">Go to office.com/setup (also microsoft365.com/setup), sign in with your subscription, and select Install Office.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">2</span><span class="pt-0.5">Open Downloads and double-click the installer package (Office installer.dmg).</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">3</span><span class="pt-0.5">When the first Office screen appears, select Continue and sign in with your Office subscription.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">4</span><span class="pt-0.5">Choose how you wish to install the setup, then Continue and follow the prompts.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">5</span><span class="pt-0.5">Open Word from Launchpad and sign in to activate.</span></li></ol></div></section><section id="uninstall" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-muted py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold">Uninstall Office</h2><div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><h3 class="mb-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold">Windows</h3><ol class="space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">1</span><span class="pt-0.5">Open the Control Panel and go to Programs.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">2</span><span class="pt-0.5">Select Uninstall a program and find Office in the list.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">3</span><span class="pt-0.5">Choose Uninstall and wait for it to finish.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">4</span><span class="pt-0.5">Restart the computer when asked.</span></li></ol></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><h3 class="mb-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold">Mac</h3><ol class="space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">1</span><span class="pt-0.5">Open your Applications folder and find the Office folder.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">2</span><span class="pt-0.5">Double-click the Office uninstaller tool.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">3</span><span class="pt-0.5">Tick the Office apps to remove and select Uninstall.</span></li></ol></div></div></div></section><section id="mobile" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-20 px-6 py-16"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold">Office setup on Android, iPhone &amp; iPad</h2><div class="mt-6 grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_1.1fr]"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><h3 class="mb-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold">Android</h3><ol class="space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">1</span><span class="pt-0.5">Activate your subscription at office.com/setup or microsoft365.com/setup first.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">2</span><span class="pt-0.5">Open the Google Play store.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">3</span><span class="pt-0.5">Search for Microsoft 365 or Word.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">4</span><span class="pt-0.5">Tap Install, then Open.</span></li></ol></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><h3 class="mb-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold">iPhone &amp; iPad</h3><ol class="space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">1</span><span class="pt-0.5">Activate your subscription at office.com/setup or microsoft365.com/setup first.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">2</span><span class="pt-0.5">Open the App Store.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">3</span><span class="pt-0.5">Search for Microsoft Word and tap Get.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground">4</span><span class="pt-0.5">Open the app and log in with your email and password.</span></li></ol></div><img src="/office/assets/mobile-88yMqu6L.jpg" alt="Phone showing a